r the Dignity of the  people of Afghanistan and it is honestly  incredibly important that the global  Community come together now before it is  too late we leave it there for the time  thank you so much for joining us a  former policy special advisor to the UK  Minister for Afghan resettlement and  Minister for refugees thank you so much
 

